N5Kvgq0.jpg"},{"id":2547623,"name":"Mariya Klyukvina","role":"Woman #1","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/gNtdbIyk9uApLduA1bqMaqSZXsz.jpg"},{"id":2930762,"name":"Tatyana Klyukina","role":"Woman #2"},{"id":2218141,"name":"Igor Yashanin","role":"Misha","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/bWIoIT63a6Gzt35cTE3DmuEL17V.jpg"},{"id":2307030,"name":"Yaroslav Efremenko","role":"Kid","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/8qZnYgk3tCl3mOQojsEy5kHMVkc.jpg"},{"id":2468494,"name":"Aleksandr Mukhin","role":"Clerk's assistant","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/bjVPw0bIuzpY1dAkrvbwD2TkMy2.jpg"},{"id":1507506,"name":"Valeriya Dmitrieva","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/j86nMvA0vDVQbGzBgpFsbx0tqt1.jpg"}],"crew":[],"videos":[],"watchProviders":[],"episodeGroups":[],"translations":[{"language":"it-IT","title":"The Bride","overview":"La moderna ragazza di città Nastya è follemente innamorata di Ivan. Manca solo il matrimonio per coronare la loro fiaba d’amore. La famiglia di Nastya è però molto legata alle tradizioni e alle abitudini della Russia imperiale del XIX secolo. Per il suo Ivan, Nastya è però pronta a sottoporsi anche a una misteriosa cerimonia che risale ai secoli più bui della storia del cristianesimo, non sospettando quali ragioni (e conseguenze) si celino dietro il rito."},{"language":"en-US","title":"The Bride","overview":"This is a story of a small town girl named Nastya. Her newly married husband Ivan drives her to his hometown to meet his family. Upon their arrival Nastya feels she made a wrong decision: she is surrounded by weird people and she sees creepy photos all around the house. Ivan disappears while his family prepares Nastya for a mysterious traditional Russian wedding ceremony. She struggles to calm herself down hoping all this will end and they will live happily ever after. Only if she stays alive..."},{"language":"ru-RU","overview":"После свадьбы Настя уговаривает мужа взять её с собой к его родственникам, которые живут в маленьком, почти заброшенном городке. Но скоро начинает сожалеть о своей просьбе. Семья Вани хочет провести таинственный свадебный обряд по своим традициям, и Настю начинают пугать страшные сны и непонятные предчувствия. Попытка понять что происходит, приводит девушку к жуткой находке — шкатулке с фотографиями мертвых людей."}],"images":{"logos":[],"posters":[],"backdrops":[]},"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/8aySOx9COFbVPAOP345uSbex8bb.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/me5utxTz6hlEgAeQisexKHP27ZU.jpg","seasons":[],"schema":{}}},"artworkLibrary":{"tmdb":{"schemaVersion":1,"source":"tmdb","id":422715,"type":"movie","originalLanguage":"ru-RU","series":{"poster":{"it":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/8aySOx9COFbVPAOP345uSbex8bb.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/8aySOx9COFbVPAOP345uSbex8bb.jpg","language":"it","width":1000,"height":1500},"candidates":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/8aySOx9COFbVPAOP345uSbex8bb.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/8aySOx9COFbVPAOP345uSbex8bb.jpg","language":"it","width":1000,"height":1500},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/cEzRh1TfuIEohV2nMWXVrIezhIe.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/cEzRh1TfuIEohV2nMWXVrIezhIe.jpg","language":"it","width":500,"height":750}]},"en":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/aKKanGgtgHxrdb1e7OKxbvpio04.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/aKKanGgtgHxrdb1e7OKxbvpio04.jpg","language":"en","width":2000,"height":3000},"candidates":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/aKKanGgtgHxrdb1e7OKxbvpio04.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/aKKanGgtgHxrdb1e7OKxbvpio04.jpg","language":"en","width":2000,"height":3000},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/wNZndH4YxYMQFBR9fAd90rGWciH.jpg